Add --no-advertising to gRPCServerCLI

GRPCServerAdvertiser starts unconditionally after bind and multicasts to
224.0.0.251:5353 for the life of the process. On a shared network that is
unwanted. The flag turns it off. Default behaviour is unchanged.
